*text*background:       #f1e6fc
*text*foreground:       #2c2c44
*text*font:             courier-12
*Text*background:       #f1e6fc
*Text*foreground:       #2c2c44
*Text*font:             courier-12
*Text_Display*background: #f1e6fc
*Text_Display*foreground: #2c2c44
